119: Remove old enable WorkspaceEnableAdoCodeSearch experiment\n* #1118: Remove old instant indexing experiment\n* #1116: Don't use ForceGpt41 experiment unless it has a context window >= the current model's\n* #1117: Remove unused parallelism option\n* #1115: Refine quality gates and validation instructions for clarity and conciseness for gpt-5\n* #993: Add GitHub Actions workflow for Copilot setup steps\n* #1113: Try removing call to `getAnyGitHubSession`\n* #1108: Don't send empty assistant messages\n* #1109: replace toolReferences in modeInstructions\n* #1107: Mixin unknown anthrtopic models with standard defaults\n* #1097: Fix some issues with workspace context not signed in\n* #1106: Cleanup\n* #1102: Allow execute prompt/task tools inside of execute prompt/task\n* #1101: Bump claude code version\n* #1099: Add Codex-style prompt\n\nThis list of changes was [auto generated](https://dev.azure.com/monacotools/Monaco/_build/results?buildId=359742&view=logs).</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-chat/releases/249870618/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}}